:seed: renta-2025
@step Record the taxpayer's employment and direct-estimation activity before supplying its instalment payments.
aeat config profile edit --quiet --accept-defaults --irpf-income-categories trabajo,actividad_economica --irpf-estimation-regime directa_simplificada --activity-start-date 2025-01-01
@step Open the annual Modelo 100 declaration for the filing year.
@setup aeat --format json app modelo work create --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A
@setup aeat --format json app ledger retencion-soportada record B00010009 --ejercicio 2025 --income-class trabajo --origin operator_declaration --retencion 2400 --ingreso-a-cuenta 0 --importe-integro 24000 --payer-name "Pagador Sintetico SL"
@step Supply a registry relation value during calculation.
@result aeat --format json app modelo work calculate --modelo 100 --year 2025 --period 0A --casilla 0003=24000 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-anterior=0 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-em4-pendiente-inicio=0 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-em3-pendiente-inicio=0 --binding renta-base-liquidable-negativa-general-em2-pendiente-inicio=0 --relation renta-modelo-130-pagos-fraccionados=450
@expect result.relation_overrides["renta-modelo-130-pagos-fraccionados"] == "450"
@expect exit_code == 0
